{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2017-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1483228800, "end_date": 1483833599, "month_true_total": 60, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:53:15 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "29087736", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135386055", "personaname": "A Psychopathic Rat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198135386055/", "num_games_owned": 192, "num_reviews": 71, "playtime_forever": 2300, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1911, "last_played": 1494628137, "avatar": "7a741b8d9d4b80e71571ba1bdb1d4fd8814f740d"}, "language": "english", "review": "As an assault marine, you can't kill someone with a thunder hammer which does OP damage. However, once they kill you, your exploding jumppack will kill them for you. 10/10 would jump pack kill again.\n\nEdit: I felt that I should make an actual helpful review. Campaign is amazing, and unlocks both a skin for Chaos and the Ultramarines in MP if you beat it. In MP, lascannons are two-shot kills, one-shot headshots. Thunderhammer is good if you can sneak up on someone. Lots of higher tier weapons are good at one-shots. The only MP servers are siege control standard, and exterminatus.\n\nExterminatus is amazing. You and a team of up to three others [solo is allowed] fight five waves of orks before moving to the next arena. There are five arenas total, each with stronger enemies. Tactical is good for when using dual weapons, devastator has certain spots that make it OP, and the assault isn't that good at anything except escaping. Exterminatus is good for low level players since the PvP servers are full of max level people. Also, exterminatus lets you kill hundreds of orks without mercy for no other reason than you can.", "timestamp_created": 1483796626, "timestamp_updated": 1483921784, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29059707", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020527632", "personaname": "AtlasONE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020527632/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 311, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 232, "last_played": 1694835942, "avatar": "a26fd274c860d8acd1465e7d36758bd696e3e79a"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you want nothing more than to fight for the emperor and cleanse the galaxy of filthy xeno scum i would recommend 10/10.", "timestamp_created": 1483708785, "timestamp_updated": 1483708785, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29051634", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069179186", "personaname": "ARV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198069179186/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 646, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 518, "last_played": 1456329524, "avatar": "64c66e0af4827706383a484b725b29e438f01605"}, "language": "english", "review": "must buy.............", "timestamp_created": 1483676391, "timestamp_updated": 1483676391, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29034035"